    <string name="ob_title">Lipovka Post</string>
    <string name="ob_text">You have been appointed postman of Lipovka, a small village by the river Lipka. The kettle is on, the cat is asleep on the letters. Your real steps carry the bag from house to house.</string>
    <string name="ob_steps_title">Your steps are the bag</string>
    <string name="ob_steps_text">The phone counts steps by itself, even when the app is closed. Every morning the post is sorted for about a usual day\'s walk. Walk, and the letters arrive.</string>
    <string name="ob_weather_title">The weather outside</string>
    <string name="ob_weather_text">The village can have your weather and your sunrise. Find your town, or skip: Lipovka has its own weather too.</string>
    <string name="ob_notify_title">Two quiet notifications</string>
    <string name="ob_notify_text">In the morning: the post has come. In the evening, only if a door is close: almost there.</string>
